---
import HerbDivider from './HerbDivider.astro';
import ChuciGlyph from './ChuciGlyph.astro';
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="shell footer-bookend">
    <HerbDivider label="水边一线 · rippleshe" quiet={true} />
    <ChuciGlyph variant="lotus" compact={true} class="footer-chuci-lotus" />
    <div class="footer-waterline" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 74" preserveAspectRatio="none">
        <path class="footer-water-a" d="M0 34c105-8 177 8 276 1 113-8 172-6 270 1 113 8 222-12 454-1" />
        <path class="footer-water-b" d="M84 46c94-5 151 6 243 0 84-6 153-4 238 2 93 6 159-4 274-2" />
        <g class="footer-fish" transform="translate(110 38)">
          <path d="M-20 0c9-10 27-10 38 0-10 10-28 10-38 0Z" />
          <path d="M-18 0l-15-9 4 9-4 9Z" />
          <circle cx="10" cy="-2" r="1.2" />
        </g>
        <g class="footer-reeds">
          <path d="M920 69c-1-25 4-44 15-61M943 71c-2-22 3-39 14-54M964 72c0-19 5-34 14-45" />
          <ellipse cx="936" cy="8" rx="4" ry="10" transform="rotate(22 936 8)" />
          <ellipse cx="958" cy="16" rx="4" ry="10" transform="rotate(28 958 16)" />
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div class="footer-signature">
        <span class="footer-monogram" aria-hidden="true">R/S</span>
        <p>Rippleshe · 数字花园、学术研制与行旅篇什。</p>
        <small>rippleshe.cyou · Thought, Code & Literary Traces.</small>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/life/">岁序日录</a>
        <a href="/scenes/">光景意象</a>
        <a href="/now/">此刻动向</a>
        <a href="/guestbook/">水边留字</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/rippleshe" target="_blank" rel="me">GitHub ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
